Root cause:
The bug was caused by a race condition introduced after a previous commit that led to the HID core discarding incoming packets while the HID driver's probe function was executing. This resulted in the loss of control packets necessary for the enumeration process of the Logitech Unifying receiver, which required these packets to be processed in conjunction with mouse and keyboard data.
